Third-party components
----------------------

None. Mind Kit has no third-party dependency and no CDN.

Vendored from this project's own kits (same licence, same author), copied verbatim on
26/11/2026:

- web-kit 0.1.0 — docs/play/web-kit.js — the offline shell, storage helpers and PWA registration
- export-kit 1.0.0 — docs/play/export-kit.js — Blob download, used to export the summary

Neither kit is modified. Neither makes a network request.

What this app is not
--------------------

It is not therapy, not a diagnosis, and not a crisis service. It computes sleep efficiency from the
times the person enters, and it holds a worry until the window they gave it. It does not diagnose
insomnia, does not set a sleep-restriction schedule, does not recommend a bedtime, and does not stand
in for a clinician. The clinical decision stays with the clinician.

The behaviour pattern is an association in the person's own diary, with the counts shown. It is not a
claim about cause and it is not advice.
